附加说明 / Additional note:

本仓库收录的蒙贤熠原文选段（write-official-document-like-mxy-jr/references/03-历届主题与时事档案.md
与 04-原文选段.md）摘自「广西·思源模拟联合国大会」历届活动方案、邀请函与秘书长致辞，
著作权归原作者及思源模拟联合国大会组委会所有。

其中收录的样本均为蒙贤熠本人手笔：第二、三、四、六届的邀请函与秘书长致辞，
以及第三至六届的活动方案选段。第五届的邀请函与秘书长致辞由第五届秘书长罗立茜撰写、
学术总监致辞由朱天羽撰写，均未收录。

Excerpts included in this repository are drawn from event proposals, invitations,
and secretary-general addresses of past Siyuan MUN conferences. Copyright remains
with the original author and the organizing committee.

All included samples were written by Meng Xianyi: the invitations and
secretary-general addresses of the 2nd, 3rd, 4th, and 6th conferences, plus event
proposal excerpts from the 3rd through 6th. The 5th conference's invitation and
secretary-general address (Luo Lixi) and academic director's address (Zhu Tianyu)
are not included.
